      "control_name": "CodePipeline Artifact Store Must Use KMS Encryption",
      "control_description": "CodePipeline artifact store must use a customer-managed KMS key. Without encryption, build artifacts — source code archives, compiled binaries, test results, deployment packages — are stored in plaintext in S3. Anyone with read access to the artifact bucket can access every version of every artifact the pipeline produced.\n",
